[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5097060032","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121833#issuecomment-5097060032","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121833","id":5097060032,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABL872wA","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-27T21:33:27Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T21:33:27Z","body":"I would love this, but let me tell you right off the bat: this is most definitely going to be controversial and indeed it **warrants** a proposal, with the same sentiments brought up here.\r\n\r\nIf it were just up to me, I would still accept this and gather public feedback, personally.\r\nMainly to protect beginners. But also, by disabling the warning you acknowledge to be doing something unexpected or unconventional, which especially nowadays a \"strings as comments\" very much is.\r\n\r\n\"Nowadays\", because using them may make even less sense with the general improvements made to the editor:\r\n- Toggling comments doesn't work the same as `4.0` and is overall regarded as more comfortable.\r\n- Words such as \"TODO\" are highlighted in comments\r\n- Documentation comments are highlighted more distinctly.\r\n- I was looking for https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/95955 but I discovered that it wasn't merged at all. If it did, it would've made writing \"multiline\" comments more comfortable, and further justify removing this.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5097060032/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5103148020","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121833#issuecomment-5103148020","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121833","id":5103148020,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMCvb9A","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-28T10:48:12Z","updated_a