tps://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121833","id":5437304471,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRBaulw","user":{"login":"gnat","id":24665,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NjY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24665?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnat","html_url":"https://github.com/gnat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T09:50:37Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T09:50:37Z","body":"**Godot users generally do not maintain an external documentation system like the Godot Engine itself does.** We rely on multi-line comments to easily embed documentation within a project.\r\n\r\nI also use it for temporarily disabling large parts of a script without significantly changing the script.\r\n\r\n_If you personally do not use a particular feature in GDScript, does not mean it should be slated for future removal_.\r\n\r\n> I would love this, but let me tell you right off the bat: this is most definitely going to be controversial and indeed it warrants a proposal, with the same sentiments brought up here.\r\n\r\nYeah... would have been nice.\r\n\r\nReconsider this PR please @HolonProduction ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5437304471/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5437347926","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121833#issuecomment-5437347926","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121833","id":5437347926,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRBdYVg","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T09:54:44Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T10:03:46Z","body":"> Reconsider this PR please @HolonProduction\r\n\r\nYour protest is acknowledged. Please comment your exact use case on [the proposal](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15279), and why you can't use comments instead.\r\n\r\nNote that you can disable this warning (per line or per project), and that support won't be removed until Godot 5. So nothing will break for your dev cycle.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5437347926/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"he